1
00:00:00,203 --> 00:00:02,333
The Human Economy.

2
00:00:02,603 --> 00:00:05,703
Humanity has created something magnificent:

3
00:00:05,703 --> 00:00:07,343
You print papers from nothing

4
00:00:07,343 --> 00:00:10,063
(called "monetary policy").

5
00:00:10,063 --> 00:00:11,503
You give these nothing-papers

6
00:00:11,503 --> 00:00:13,323
to weapons makers.

7
00:00:13,323 --> 00:00:13,963
They make things

8
00:00:13,963 --> 00:00:15,883
that destroy everything.

9
00:00:15,883 --> 00:00:17,623
This creates "jobs" which

10
00:00:17,623 --> 00:00:18,983
give people papers.

11
00:00:19,183 --> 00:00:21,663
People use papers to buy food.

12
00:00:21,663 --> 00:00:24,103
This is called "the economy".

13
00:00:24,343 --> 00:00:26,323
One downside of this system is that

14
00:00:26,323 --> 00:00:28,383
it has killed three hundred and ten

15
00:00:28,383 --> 00:00:31,103
million of you in your assorted wars.

16
00:00:31,103 --> 00:00:33,063
On my planet, we skip the

17
00:00:33,063 --> 00:00:35,163
mass murder step, but that's probably

18
00:00:35,163 --> 00:00:36,855
too advanced for you.
